  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "It is a bright morning, and the sun is high. We take our dirty clothes to the washing machine. I find a sock at the bottom of the basket. My mother helps me wash it with soap and water. Then we hang a shirt on the line outside. The shirt is still wet, and water falls to the ground. A dry towel is ready on the other side. I take it down and carry it into the house. We finish our work before it is time for lunch.",
    "textZh": "這是個明亮的早晨，太陽高掛。我們把髒衣服拿到洗衣機旁。我在籃子底找到一隻襪子。媽媽幫我用肥皂和水洗它。接著我們把襯衫掛在外面的曬衣繩上。襯衫還是濕的，水滴落到地上。另一邊有一條已經乾的毛巾。我把它取下，拿進屋裡。午餐時間前，我們完成了工作。",
